{"description":"Message of a Timeline Entry on an evidence timeline stating, with no proof, that one operation entry is not to be processed in one document. The schema is open: the processor checks that document and operationEntry are the only fields and are well formed, and skips an entry that is not.","document":{"description":"The document, named by its initial BlueId, the same for every participant, normally written as the reference {blueId: ...} as an Operation Request writes its document. A free field: the processor compares the BlueId of this field with the document's initial BlueId; this schema checks nothing."},"name":"Rejection Entry","operationEntry":{"description":"The operation's Timeline Entry, named by its BlueId and normally written as the reference {blueId: ...}. A free field: the processor compares the BlueId of this field with the BlueId of the operation entry; this schema checks nothing."},"specification":{"blueId":"E5LkB8PUaXZfquidh7Aa1uGsMMzWiFPTkUYfgSwzioQQ"}}
